WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
I smell fish soup

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,000
The nose is quite sharp

3
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:06,360
You even got out the salt

4
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:08,760
So don’t ask me every day why I eat better than you

5
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:09,960
not luck

6
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:11,960
It's all done step by step

7
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:13,960
So what should I do today?

8
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,260
Can you teach me this?

9
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:18,660
I will make my own salt from now on

10
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:20,860
I don’t need to bother you all the time. I can teach you.

11
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:22,260
But knowledge is also a resource

12
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:23,260
What would you give in exchange?

13
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,460
I've been working for you

14
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:26,260
Tonight's work is exchanged for tonight's meal

15
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,060
Excludes salt treatment methods

16
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:30,660
Let’s wait until I have more valuable news.

17
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:32,460
You are really clear about the accounts here.

18
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:35,140
By the hour

19
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:37,740
Why hasn't he come out? Changmao is still there. He must not have left.

20
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:46,320
with sea water
